INSTITUTIONAL CONTRACTS
	1.	PRSL-AI Ecosystem
Defines the overall ecosystem, its purpose, values, boundaries, relationships, and evolution.
	2.	iRiel Personal Intelligence
The unified Personal Intelligence system.
iRiel Personal Intelligence is ONE system.
Identity, Context, Memory, Accessibility, Privacy, Resonance, Routing, Intelligence, Feedback, Devices, and other capabilities are constitutive dimensions of the same Personal Intelligence.
AI models and providers are replaceable.
	3.	iRiel Intelligence Server
Defines the intelligence infrastructure responsible for providing and executing intelligence capabilities within the iRiel environment.
	4.	iRiel Maestro Resonance
Defines the orchestration, coherence, continuity, and coordination of the iRiel ecosystem.
Maestro does not define the purpose of PRSL-AI.
Maestro preserves and operationalizes the purpose established by The Principle.
Maestro coordinates contracts; it does not replace them.
The human purpose remains above orchestration.
	5.	iRiel System
Defines the system environment through which iRiel operates, maintains state, interacts with the underlying platform, and provides continuity across system-level capabilities.
	6.	iRiel Router
Defines intelligence and capability routing.
The Router determines which provider, model, capability, execution environment, or fallback is appropriate according to the applicable context, privacy, capability, latency, cost, and system constraints.
	7.	iRiel-AI Core AI
Defines the AI intelligence core used by the iRiel ecosystem.
The AI layer is replaceable.
No specific model, provider, or AI technology defines the identity of iRiel.
	8.	iRiel-AI Ecosystem
Defines the broader AI-oriented ecosystem surrounding iRiel-AI, including AI capabilities, integrations, services, providers, tools, and extensibility.
