CORE INVARIANTS
The Principle is inviolable.
iRiel Personal Intelligence is one unified system.
The human purpose cannot become secondary.
Accessibility and Inclusion remain foundational.
Privacy by Default remains foundational.
AI is replaceable.
Models are replaceable.
Providers are replaceable.
Devices are replaceable.
Implementations are replaceable.
Architecture may evolve.
Contracts may evolve.
The originating human purpose cannot be removed without changing the identity of the system.
CANONICAL RULE
Do not invent contracts to complete a list.
Catalog the contracts that already exist in the architecture.
The purpose of the Contract Registry is not to create the PRSL-AI architecture.
The purpose is to make the existing architecture explicit, organized, traceable, versionable, and canonical.
