THE FUNDAMENTAL RELATIONSHIP
The PRSL-AI Ecosystem contracts with itself.
Its contracts continuously reference, constrain, inform, and validate one another.
The ecosystem can therefore evolve without losing the values that gave rise to it.
The architecture may become more sophisticated.
The technology may change.
The intelligence providers may change.
The devices may change.
The implementation may change.
The human purpose must not.